</TAI><BRK/>
<OLI>Configure scheduling as indicated and as shown on the points schedule.  <TAI OPT="MODBUS,OPC">Configure M&amp;C Software scheduling 
functionality to schedule <TAI OPT="MODBUS">Modbus systems</TAI><TAI OPT="OPC"><TAI OPT="MODBUS"> and</TAI>OPC systems</TAI>.</TAI> <TAI OPT="LONWORKS">Configure M&amp;C Software scheduling functionality 
for LonWorks field control systems which do not use the Simple Scheduler Object.  For LonWorks field 
