field control system.</TAI> <BRK/>
<BRK/>
Create and configure displays for configuration of <TAI OPT="LONWORKS,MODBUS,OPC">M&amp;C Software schedules <TAI OPT="LONWORKS">and Simple Scheduler Objects 
in the field control system </TAI><TAI OPT="BACNET,NIAGARA FRAMEWORK">and </TAI></TAI><TAI OPT="BACNET,NIAGARA FRAMEWORK">Schedule Objects in the field control system</TAI>.  Label schedules and scheduled 
points with full English-language descriptors.  Provide a separate configuration capability for each 
